{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to <i>The Station</i> \u2014 a remote outpost orbiting the edge of deep space, where something has gone very wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are not the hero. You don\u2019t explore. You don\u2019t fight. You watch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The Station</i> is a minimalist anomaly-spotting game where you monitor a network of surveillance cameras, flipping between feeds to identify subtle changes. A chair moves. A shadow lingers. A figure appears where no one should be. Your job is to catch these irregularities before they spiral out of control \u2014 or worse, before you start doubting what you saw at all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by games like <i>I'm on Observation Duty</i>, <i>The Station</i> focuses on quiet tension, pattern recognition, and the eerie feeling of watching something... watch back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are no jump scares. No combat. Just you, the cameras, and whatever\u2019s creeping through the corridors.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3765880?t=1748396373","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3765880?t=1748396373","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765880/72bb5c91351fb3c24625dbff49727f9e2258d9e5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748396373","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765880/72bb5c91351fb3c24625dbff49727f9e2258d9e5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748396373","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3767050,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to <i>The Station</i> \u2014 a remote outpost orbiting the edge of deep space, where something has gone very wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are not the hero. You don\u2019t explore. You don\u2019t fight. You watch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The Station</i> is a minimalist anomaly-spotting game where you monitor a network of surveillance cameras, flipping between feeds to identify subtle changes. A chair moves. A shadow lingers. A figure appears where no one should be. Your job is to catch these irregularities before they spiral out of control \u2014 or worse, before you start doubting what you saw at all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by games like <i>I'm on Observation Duty</i>, <i>The Station</i> focuses on quiet tension, pattern recognition, and the eerie feeling of watching something... watch back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are no jump scares. No combat. Just you, the cameras, and whatever\u2019s creeping through the corridors.</p>","developers":["Sean Steel"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765880/858768afc9b84d5066de9a05152489e9885ada1e/header.jpg?t=1748396373","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257143937,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257143937/movie480.mp4?t=1748289310","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257143937/movie_max.mp4?t=1748289310"},"name":"GamePlay1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257143937/fa86ed2710f4d778ccf69f4c86904361e0de1643/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748289310","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257143937/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1748289310","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257143937/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1748289310"}}],"name":"The Station: Observer Protocol","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10, Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 